atom_modify sort 0 0
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check no
timestep 0.25
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step pe ke etotal temp
thermo_modify format float %.17g
min_style cg
minimize 1e-8 1e-8 100 1000
